#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) to manage users with or "
"without an IBM Cloud account"
msgstr ""
"استخدم IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) لإدارة المستخدمين سواء كان"
" لديهم حساب IBM Cloud أم لا"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users"
msgstr "إدارة مستخدمي موفّر الهوية"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users {#manage-id-provider-users}"
msgstr "إدارة مستخدمي موفّر الهوية {#manage-id-provider-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can integrate with your external identity provider (IDP) to securely "
"authenticate external users to your IBM Cloud account. By using an external "
"provider, you can provide a way for users in your company to use single "
"sign-on (SSO). You can connect your cloud account to an external IDP one of "
"the following ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"يمكنك الدمج مع موفّر الهوية الخارجي (IDP) الخاص بك لمصادقة المستخدمين "
"الخارجيين بأمان على حساب IBM Cloud. باستخدام موفّر خارجي، يمكنك توفير طريقة "
"لمستخدمي شركتك لاستخدام تسجيل الدخول الأحادي (SSO). يمكنك ربط حساب السحابة "
"الخاص بك بـ IDP خارجي بإحدى الطرق التالية:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider "
"(SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"
msgstr ""
"استخدام [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider "
"(SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-appid) (might incur a cost)\n"
msgstr ""
"استخدام [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-appid) (قد يترتب عليه تكلفة)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Federate your users to all IBM&reg; products with "
"IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-ibmid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[ربط مستخدميك بجميع منتجات IBM&reg; عبر "
"IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-ibmid)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"After connecting your IDP, you can set up dynamic rules so you don't have to manually add every user to every group when they join.  See [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) for instructions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"بعد ربط موفّر الهوية الخاص بك، يمكنك إعداد قواعد ديناميكية حتى لا تضطر إلى إضافة كل مستخدم يدويًا إلى كل مجموعة عند انضمامه. راجع [تفعيل المصادقة من موفّر هوية خارجي](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) للاطلاع على التعليمات.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "الخطوات التالية {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * Refer to the [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration) topic.\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"توصيات\">\n"
"   * راجع موضوع [تفعيل المصادقة من موفّر هوية خارجي](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration).\n"
"   * اطلع على [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) لمزيد من المعلومات.\n"
"   * راجع [توثيق App ID الكامل.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
